      {
        "heading": "THE SUN & MOON CYCLE",
        "detail": "The dial in the upper scroll turns relentlessly. By Day, you tread the stone as mortal Sabreman. When Night falls, you transform into a fearsome Werewolf."
      },
      {
        "heading": "THE CAULDRON QUEST",
        "detail": "Melkhior's cauldron summons specific charms one by one (shown in the lower scroll). Carry the requested charm to Room 136 and drop it into the cauldron."
      },
      {
        "heading": "CASTLE NAVIGATION & WISDOM",
        "detail": "Press [M] at any time to inspect the 16×16 Castle Map. Press [H] in any chamber to seek Melkhior's Wisdom for puzzle hints and hazards."
      },
      {
        "heading": "EXPLORER CONTROLS",
        "detail": "WASD / Arrows to Move • Space to Jump • Shift to Pick Up & Drop • Esc / P to Pause • Tab to Toggle Rotational vs Directional Movement."
